                <pb facs="0713" n="589" sameAs="frus:frus1923v02/pg589"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">881.512/31: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé at Tangier</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Rand</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-07-11T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 11, 1923—4
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>17. Your July 4, 1 p.m.</p>
                <p>Before complying with your recommendation, Department desires your opinion by
                    cable of feasibility and method to be followed in securing deposit with Agency
                    of amount of taxes improperly collected from American citizens and protégés
                    similar to course pursued by British mentioned in your June 26, 3 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
